What Are Nicotine Pouches?

Nicotine pouches are discreet, tobacco-free pouches designed to provide a controlled dose of nicotine. Users place the pouch between their gum and lip, allowing nicotine to be absorbed through the oral mucosa. Unlike traditional chewing tobacco or snuff, nicotine pouches do not contain tobacco leaf, making them a cleaner and often more palatable option for those seeking nicotine satisfaction without the accompanying smell or mess.

